# ================================================
# InsureMate AI Agent — Environment Configuration
# ================================================
# 
# ⚠️  IMPORTANT: You MUST add at least ONE real API key below!
#     The agent will NOT work with placeholder values.
#
# 🆓 RECOMMENDED: Get a FREE Groq API key (takes 2 minutes)
#     👉 https://console.groq.com → API Keys → Create New
#

# ── PRIMARY: Groq (FASTEST & FREE - RECOMMENDED) ─────────────
# 1. Go to: https://console.groq.com/keys
# 2. Click "Create API Key"
# 3. Copy the key (starts with "gsk_...")
# 4. Paste it below:
GROQ_API_KEY=
GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# ── ALTERNATIVE 1: Google Gemini (FREE & UNLIMITED) ──────────
# 1. Go to: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Click "Create API Key"
# 3. Copy and paste below:
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash-exp

# ── ALTERNATIVE 2: OpenRouter (PAID - $5 minimum) ────────────
# 1. Go to: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# 2. Sign up and add credits
# 3. Create key and paste:
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_MODEL=anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet

# ── ALTERNATIVE 3: OpenAI (PAID) ─────────────────────────────
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 📝 SETUP CHECKLIST:
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 
# [ ] 1. Get at least ONE API key from above
# [ ] 2. Paste it in this file (remove the placeholder)
# [ ] 3. Save this file as: .env (remove .example.fixed)
# [ ] 4. Run: python diagnose.py
# [ ] 5. Run: python test_fixed_agent.py
# [ ] 6. Start server: python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload
# 
# ⚠️  Common Mistakes:
#     - Leaving placeholder text like "your_key_here"
#     - Not saving the file as .env
#     - Not restarting the server after changing keys
#
# ✅ After setup, agent will provide document-based answers!
#
